            {
              "text": "The beginning of the shopping scene reveals Marie Antoinette's novelty and teenage instincts. A big close up shot and panning of a range of shoes. This emphasises that Maria Antoinette is in a position of luxury as well as the novelty of materialism. \n"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
