      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "This big close up shot of Marie Antoinette’s feet while trying on luxurious shoes with the Converse sneakers in the background emphasises that Maria is young and an inexperienced queen who takes pleasure in consumerism, revealing the human nature of teenage girls.   "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The Converse sneakers also act as an anachronism, reminding the audience that this is historical fiction, not a historically accurate film."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
